### Apply Leave
POST http://localhost:3000/api/applyLeave
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anshika",
  "employeeId": "E001",
  "fromDate": "2025-09-28",
  "toDate": "2025-09-30",
  "reason": "Vacation"
}

### Get All Leaves
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leaves

### Get Flagged Leaves
GET http://localhost:3000/api/leaves/flagged

### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anshika",
  "employeeId": "E001",
  "email": "anshika@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

